From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Martin Lund <mrlund@hotmail.com>
Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 11:16:48 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] ASoC: qcom: q6apm-lpass-dais: let the I2S DAIs take a format

q6i2s_ops has no .set_fmt, so snd_soc_dai_set_fmt() on an MI2S
back end never reaches q6i2s_set_fmt(). The I2S module's ws_src
then stays external and the DSP does not drive BCLK or WS for
amplifiers that expect the SoC to be the clock provider, as the
OnePlus 13's do on Secondary MI2S.
---
 sound/soc/qcom/qdsp6/q6apm-lpass-dais.c | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/sound/soc/qcom/qdsp6/q6apm-lpass-dais.c b/sound/soc/qcom/qdsp6/q6apm-lpass-dais.c
index a0d90462f..36c034819 100644
--- a/sound/soc/qcom/qdsp6/q6apm-lpass-dais.c
+++ b/sound/soc/qcom/qdsp6/q6apm-lpass-dais.c
@@ -260,6 +260,7 @@ static const struct snd_soc_dai_ops q6i2s_ops = {
 	.shutdown	= q6apm_lpass_dai_shutdown,
 	.set_channel_map  = q6dma_set_channel_map,
 	.hw_params        = q6dma_hw_params,
+	.set_fmt	= q6i2s_set_fmt,
 };
 
 static const struct snd_soc_dai_ops q6hdmi_ops = {
-- 
2.55.0

